    { q: "What might a basic essay outline typically include?", options: ["Only the title", "An introduction, main points with supporting details, and a conclusion", "Random unrelated notes", "Nothing structured at all"], correct: 1, explanation: "A basic outline typically includes an introduction, key main points (often with supporting details), and a conclusion." },
    { q: "How can outlining help improve the writing process?", options: ["It has no real benefit", "It helps ensure logical organization and can save time during drafting", "Outlining always makes writing take longer overall", "Outlines are only useful for short essays"], correct: 1, explanation: "Outlining helps ensure a logical structure and can actually save time during the drafting process by clarifying ideas beforehand." }
